


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_f7488248:



    voice "d/HIN_1096"
    hina "「……喂？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_04b6cdb1:



    voice "d/FUM_0921"
    fumi "「……怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_86078e38:



    voice "d/HIN_1097"
    hina "「在穿上胸罩前我摸摸行不行？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_afa2c890:



    voice "d/FUM_0922"
    fumi "「啊……在这里吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_6a14ce9a:



    voice "d/HIN_1098"
    hina "「嗯。行吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_251217bc:


    "又是刚才那样，眼神闪闪发光。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_7b0798af:



    voice "d/FUM_0923"
    fumi "「……只摸一小会儿的话」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_c11c6d33:



    voice "d/HIN_1099"
    hina "「太棒了♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_115d1156:


    "连败。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_5533e5f9:


    "文侧开脸将自己的胸挺到阳菜眼前。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_df795f7c:


    "噗哟。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_2aea6ffe:



    voice "d/FUM_0924"
    fumi "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_4366eb7f:



    voice "d/HIN_1100"
    hina "「噢噢！和隔着睡衣摸的触感不一样。不过果然特别柔软」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_d419fead:


    "阳菜边感叹着边尝试把胸捧起来，又或是挤到一起。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_a1dd6022:



    voice "d/HIN_1101"
    hina "「……呐，那之后是不是又大了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_94f28af8:



    voice "d/FUM_0925"
    fumi "「不会那么快就变大的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_5ddb2c6f:


    "阳菜不厌其烦地揉着文的胸，享受着柔软的触感和变幻无穷的形状。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_f0ba609b:


    "但不知何时她一开始的好奇渐渐褪去——"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_5f4ba6ec:



    voice "d/FUM_0926"
    fumi "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_1fb07dd4:


    "阳菜的手指碰到了丰满的尖端。这一碰，就算隔着衬衫也引来了文诱人的叫声。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_6f5781a0:



    voice "d/HIN_1102"
    hina "「弄痛你了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_3150d66b:



    voice "d/FUM_0927"
    fumi "「倒不痛……就是有点吓到了」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_7ca9bc6c:



    voice "d/HIN_1103"
    hina "「嗯？这里好像有点硬？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_e536e6a1:


    "文的脸颊瞬间烧了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_1178ad5b:



    voice "d/FUM_0928"
    fumi "「这，这个……那是！」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_dacde023:


    "阳菜捏住衬衫上凸出来的两点。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_a2319444:



    voice "d/FUM_0929"
    fumi "「啊啊嗯！」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_b5ca706c:



    voice "d/HIN_1104"
    hina "「呜哇！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_56095a84:


    "两个人都吓到了。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_35a2c5d8:



    voice "d/FUM_0930"
    fumi "「等，等下……那里不行！」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_0fc4ba37:



    voice "d/HIN_1105"
    hina "「肿了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_26fa4bc8:



    voice "d/FUM_0931"
    fumi "「不是肿了……那个，那里……舒服的时候就会那样」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_24faf478:



    voice "d/HIN_1106"
    hina "「舒服？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_fb5724a7:


    "文默默地点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_4f16f7a4:



    voice "d/HIN_1107"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_27d81705:


    "阳菜注视了会儿文的胸。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_cca6971c:



    voice "d/HIN_1108"
    hina "「能脱光让我直接看看吗？还可以摸摸吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_b297ca9e:


    "提出了更难接受的请求。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_15fab88a:



    voice "d/FUM_0932"
    fumi "「……直接摸吗！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_0af56644:


    "这确实让文犹豫了。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_fbc0d576:



    voice "d/HIN_1109"
    hina "「我想看小文的胸」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_4f7b8e1b:



    voice "d/FUM_0933"
    fumi "「呜呜……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_05_d_440c1346:


    "……浅生文体会了今天的第三次败北。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_833de43b:



    voice "d/HIN_1110"
    hina "「哇啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_8c132dd5:


    "碰到文乳房的阳菜从内心深处发出了感叹。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_39862af0:



    voice "d/HIN_1111"
    hina "「好漂亮！好滑嫩！好柔软！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_55819ef5:


    "阳菜一会看看乳房一会看看文的脸，嘴里连连发出赞美。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_7bc9b442:


    "而文的脸上红得发烫。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_c3004d6f:



    voice "d/FUM_0934"
    fumi "「呜……谢谢夸奖」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_dd9223ad:


    "害羞得只能说出这种话来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_b77bda1f:



    voice "d/HIN_1112"
    hina "「这样直接看感觉更大啊。你平时是不是都压住了？不难受吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_39a4ac0d:



    voice "d/FUM_0935"
    fumi "「有时候会觉得有点闷，但总不能不穿吧……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_40100622:



    voice "d/HIN_1113"
    hina "「真辛苦啊，我就算是挤到一起抬起来，也不会有太大改变呢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_5bdd947e:


    "阳菜这么说着低头看了眼自己的胸部。视线畅通无阻，一直能看到脚。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_fa99b7cb:



    voice "d/FUM_0936"
    fumi "「要是能分给你点就好了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_c86db9f7:



    voice "d/HIN_1114"
    hina "「要是能分给我点就好了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_60e24806:


    "两人互相看着对方如此说道。想法明明如此一致，可不幸的是无法如愿。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_d01b2d93:



    voice "d/FUM_0937"
    fumi "「那个……差不多应该可以穿上衣服了吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_54cf0481:



    voice "d/HIN_1115"
    hina "「啊，冷吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_21ec1fa1:



    voice "d/FUM_0938"
    fumi "「不是……不如说是热……这样，好害羞的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_731f1916:



    voice "d/HIN_1116"
    hina "「但你的乳头，都翘起来了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_e08d3756:



    voice "d/FUM_0939"
    fumi "「讨厌啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_e111b583:


    "面对阳菜没经思考就指出来的事情，文羞耻地叫出声来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_05dcbddd:



    voice "d/HIN_1117"
    hina "「唉？唉？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_561e59f6:



    voice "d/FUM_0940"
    fumi "「所以……我说了并不是因为冷……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_8d5ab528:



    voice "d/HIN_1118"
    hina "「嗯？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_d64f87f7:



    voice "d/FUM_0941"
    fumi "「那个……心跳加速的时候，就会变成这样子！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_1f8d2338:



    voice "d/HIN_1119"
    hina "「心跳加速？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_ae00d252:



    voice "d/FUM_0942"
    fumi "「呀！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_ff7353df:


    "阳菜把头靠到文的胸口，耳朵紧紧地贴在上面。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_7a0c7e76:



    voice "d/HIN_1120"
    hina "「真的啊……跳得特别快」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_4f997f5c:



    voice "d/FUM_0943"
    fumi "「呃、嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_c8be7df7:


    "面对阳菜如此自然的行为，文只能附和。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_8811b7c6:



    voice "d/HIN_1121"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_e159b377:


    "接着，没想到阳菜的眼前就是——"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_6c82bd8a:



    voice "d/FUM_0944"
    fumi "「怎么了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_9814dcdc:



    voice "d/HIN_1122"
    hina "「我能亲这里吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_047c20c5:



    voice "d/FUM_0945"
    fumi "「诶！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_997567c8:



    voice "d/FUM_0946"
    fumi "「那个……那里要是被亲了的话，我……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_bd403927:



    voice "d/HIN_1123"
    hina "「怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_196a00b8:



    voice "d/FUM_0947"
    fumi "「呜呜……我，会有感觉的……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_149fd7dd:



    voice "d/FUM_0948"
    fumi "「刚才也是……阳菜的手指稍稍擦到那里我就发出了奇怪的叫声……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_d4d14ce4:



    voice "d/HIN_1124"
    hina "「有感觉是指舒服的意思吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_dd522db8:



    voice "d/FUM_0949"
    fumi "「嗯、是……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_04cdfc49:



    voice "d/HIN_1125"
    hina "「那就有感觉嘛？刚刚小文的叫声也特别可爱」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_3c362ff7:



    voice "d/FUM_0950"
    fumi "「可爱吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_4f4ca190:



    voice "d/HIN_1126"
    hina "「嗯，所以我还想听」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_3056ee09:



    voice "d/FUM_0951"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_5f637faf:



    voice "d/FUM_0952"
    fumi "「啊……嗯……唔！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_9fb0355e:


    "阳菜的舌尖接触到东西的同时，险些尖叫出声的文将声音压了回去。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_8393f93c:


    "因为刚刚被夸奖很可爱，所以反而不敢发出声音来了吧。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_0e78f875:



    voice "d/HIN_1127"
    hina "「嗯……啾……嗯呼」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_2e88a68f:


    "阳菜完全不知道文现在是什么感觉，只是单纯地享受着文充血的乳头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_9bc2a1ff:



    voice "d/HIN_1128"
    hina "「啊哈……感觉我好像变回了婴儿」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_81d4aabe:


    "时而用嘴唇夹住，时而用舌头舔舐……"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_801da094:


    "并没有想着运用技巧让文更舒服，只是一味地忠于自己的冲动。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_0fbdda35:



    voice "d/HIN_1129"
    hina "「啵……小文，小文？在我舔的时候，这里越来越硬了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_80f12205:


    "阳菜很开心地汇报道。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_b47f6d7d:



    voice "d/FUM_0953"
    fumi "「啊……嗯嗯……那是因为……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_827ddfa9:


    "这可以说是毫无自觉的调戏吧。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_9228785d:



    voice "d/HIN_1130"
    hina "「这代表，你现在很舒服吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_c8b4d6d2:



    voice "d/FUM_0954"
    fumi "「…………好的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_23e2aecd:


    "本想组织措辞，但文还是没想出来，最终便简短地应了一句。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_752a7e85:



    voice "d/HIN_1131"
    hina "「这样啊……感觉好开心啊。我做的事情让小文感觉到舒服了啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_0da6bc2d:


    "阳菜的笑容十分阳光。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_6581e505:



    voice "d/HIN_1132"
    hina "「啊，只宠爱左边的话，右边会寂寞的吧」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_d07c30e3:



    voice "d/FUM_0955"
    fumi "「诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_bdf3bf70:


    "很快，阳菜将嘴唇靠近到右边的乳房上。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_fdfa11db:



    voice "d/FUM_0956"
    fumi "「嗯嗯！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_02da177a:



    voice "d/HIN_1133"
    hina "「哪边都是小文可爱的胸部，我得平等地疼爱她们！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_8e704719:


    "阳菜说着傻气的台词，但表情显得那么认真。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_0fd44ef7:



    voice "d/HIN_1134"
    hina "「嗯……啾……嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_ee8e48f5:


    "正如她所说，刚刚对左胸做过的，又在右边重复了一遍。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_56416b07:



    voice "d/HIN_1135"
    hina "「嗯……小文……啾溜……右边和左边……哪边感觉更舒服？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_8895ceb9:



    voice "d/FUM_0957"
    fumi "「嗯……哪边……我想想……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_ba374fc0:


    "文也是个正经的人，便认真地思考了下回答道。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_d612c9cd:



    voice "d/FUM_0958"
    fumi "「那个……两边都一样……舒服」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_c8212695:



    voice "d/HIN_1136"
    hina "「原来乳齿……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_bb622101:


    "左右来回端详的阳菜，慢慢将两边挤到一起。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_b973d2b7:



    voice "d/FUM_0959"
    fumi "「啊嗯！做，做什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_73cfa141:



    voice "d/HIN_1137"
    hina "「嗯，因为小文的胸很大所以——」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_5b0d7e35:


    "解释到一半，阳菜便一口含下了挤在一起的乳头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_22164103:



    voice "d/FUM_0960"
    fumi "「啊啊啊……嗯嗯！！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_1bfbd0d1:


    "面对突然地同时攻击，文一直忍耐的理性终于决堤了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_a5c87fb1:



    voice "d/HIN_1138"
    hina "「是不是更舒服了？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_b3c1a44f:


    "阳菜得意地抬起头问道。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_64601053:



    voice "d/FUM_0961"
    fumi "「那个……呃……是的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_2115c9ac:


    "似乎是放弃了如何组织语言。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_004cf416:



    voice "d/HIN_1139"
    hina "「那我继续了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_145830c3:



    voice "d/FUM_0962"
    fumi "「诶……啊……哈啊啊啊啊啊嗯！！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_5245aaee:


    "又是突然袭击。每次都是行动先于解释。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_a3411c83:



    voice "d/FUM_0963"
    fumi "「啊……嗯嗯……啊，啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_b2d07765:


    "接连不断的刺激让文连抗议的力气都荡然无存。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_69fdab14:



    voice "d/HIN_1140"
    hina "「嗯……啾溜……哈啊……舔……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_6ce02494:


    "阳菜似乎受文如此剧烈反应的影响，开始尝试起舌头的各种动作。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_814e2cc8:



    voice "d/FUM_0964"
    fumi "「再这么……使劲嘬下去……啊啊嗯！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_4cd39828:



    voice "d/HIN_1141"
    hina "「嗯……会吸出奶水来吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_fb36d627:



    voice "d/FUM_0965"
    fumi "「才不会出来呢！……嗯嗯啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_1945c7fc:


    "阳菜不止没停下嘴和舌头，连双手也开始揉起文的胸脯。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_512e9204:



    voice "d/HIN_1142"
    hina "「嗯啾……嗯嗯……舌头和手，都好舒服……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_3f41a58b:



    voice "d/FUM_0966"
    fumi "「啊……啊嗯……啊啊啊啊啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_6702f87d:


    "叫声更大了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_195ed8cc:



    voice "d/FUM_0967"
    fumi "「不要……大脑有点空白……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_7dbd1954:


    "文的眼睛开始失焦变得涣散。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_a1eea128:



    voice "d/HIN_1143"
    hina "「哈……哈啊……我也是……小文……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_9eaf609f:


    "阳菜兴许是因为埋头又舔又吸得太卖力了，才缺氧导致的大脑放空。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_45a81aaf:



    voice "d/FUM_0968"
    fumi "「啊……不要，不要……要晕过去了……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_bf2ccb6d:



    voice "d/HIN_1144"
    hina "「小文，小文……！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_8a9aa1a8:


    "文像快失神一般。阳菜则紧紧埋在文的胸前。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene01_545365b9:



    voice "d/FUM_0969"
    fumi "「啊，啊啊……啊啊啊啊啊嗯……嗯嗯！！！！」"


